<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64990" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάραν-σις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing to die away</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. πυρός</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σβέσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Juv.</u>
				469b22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Resp.</u>
				474b20
			</span></i>; of the sun's action on wind, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				361b21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dying</i> or <i>fading away</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				372b19
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαράνσει τὸν βίον ἐκλείπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					871b17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ μαράνσεως καὶ λήθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
